   "accessed": "2026-11-12",
   "note": "Gauge maker. The same table without the 27 threads per inch row and without the 8 to 12 in column. Second table: pitch diameter tolerance plus on a GO work plug, minus on a NOT GO work plug, minus on a GO ring, plus on a NOT GO ring."
