   "accessed": "2026-11-12",
   "note": "Gauge maker's chart. Plug: GO basic for all classes, NOT GO for class 2B and 3B, 'GO = +, NO GO = -'. Ring: GO and NOT GO for class 2A and 3A, 'GO = -, NO GO = +'."
  },
  "WP_CHART": {
